From 1fe84f0bd9e0a70d06872a9c3a2aff6a9504e572 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Long Luu <long.luu.ur@renesas.com>
Date: Tue, 29 Mar 2022 09:40:43 +0700
Subject: [PATCH 08/20] drivers: pwm: Add gpt choosing GPT operation

GPT has many functions now. This patch add choosing GPT
operation via sysfs. It helps prevent registers conflict
between modes and add more functions easier in future

Signed-off-by: Long Luu <long.luu.ur@renesas.com>
Signed-off-by: Au Dang <au.dang.jx@renesas.com>
---
 drivers/pwm/gpt-rzg2l.c | 346 ++++++++++++++++++++++++----------------
 1 file changed, 209 insertions(+), 137 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/pwm/gpt-rzg2l.c b/drivers/pwm/gpt-rzg2l.c
index e9e3887ffbca..bfe6dd7c1a1f 100644
--- a/drivers/pwm/gpt-rzg2l.c
